   "source": [
    "# Customer Churn Prediction — Telco Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "End-to-end notebook: load data → EDA → preprocessing → train three\n",
    "models (Decision Tree, Random Forest, XGBoost) → evaluate → select the\n",
    "best model → save the model **and** the preprocessing artifacts with\n",
    "`joblib` so the same pipeline can be reused by the Streamlit app.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Sections**\n",
    "1. Imports\n",
    "2. Load & inspect the data\n",
    "3. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)\n",
    "4. Preprocessing (reusable for the app)\n",
    "5. Train/test split & class imbalance\n",
    "6. Model training — Decision Tree, Random Forest, XGBoost\n",
    "7. Evaluation & model comparison\n",
    "8. Select the best model\n",
    "9. Save model + preprocessing artifacts with joblib\n",
    "10. Quick sanity check — reload and predict on a sample input\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ff214225",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
