    "## 9. Save the Model + Preprocessing Artifacts (joblib)\n",
    "\n",
    "Everything the web app needs to go from a **raw customer record** to a\n",
    "**prediction** is bundled together and saved with `joblib`:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `best_model` — the trained classifier\n",
    "- `encoders` — dict of `{column_name: fitted LabelEncoder}`\n",
    "- `scaler` — fitted `StandardScaler` (optional use downstream)\n",
    "- `feature_names` — exact column order the model expects\n",
    "- `categorical_cols` — which columns need label-encoding at inference time\n",
    "- `best_model_name` / test metrics — for display in the app"
